#: ../userguides/results_summary.rst:97
#: 7d8dbc6c0ac646eead719b25e85d4cc6
msgid "Click **\"Download CSV\"** in the summary panel to save the numbers as a table – one row per layer or class, with the counts and the totals. Use it to attach the figures to a report, or to compare several processings of the same area."
